    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that a climate model fails to reproduce observed regional variations in cloud response to aerosols because its precipitation scheme only simulates rain suppression, ignoring crucial macrophysical feedbacks like evaporation that can decrease cloud water, as revealed by A-Train satellite data.",
